# Personal financial data — never commit plaintext. Only the encrypted
# store (data/transactions.csv.enc) is meant to be tracked; see
# scripts/encrypt_store.py and README.md. Raw bank exports (xlsx/xls) belong
# outside this repo entirely (see README), but ignore them repo-wide too as
# a safety net in case one ever lands here by accident.
data/*.csv
data/*.dec
*.xlsx
*.xls

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.ipynb_checkpoints/

.venv/
.DS_Store
.env
